Error [E0928]: `test` is a built-in lifecycle verb, not a task name
  --> tests/ui/task_reserved_lifecycle.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | #Task
    | ^^^^^
 Why: `run`, `dev`, `build`, and `test` already name Jet's built-in entry points — a `#Task fn` picks a user-chosen verb beside them (D-JPK-TASKRUN1).
 Fix: rename it, e.g. `#Task fn test_assets()`, or drop `#Task` if this is the lifecycle entry.
reserved: run, dev, build, test
